    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d195">

                <pb facs="0188" n="182" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg182"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr.
                            Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-25"><hi rendition="#italic">April 25,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith copy of a letter of the
                    19th instant from the Acting Secretary of the Navy, covering an order issued to
                    Commander O. E. Clark, United States Navy, who has been detailed to command a
                    force of naval vessels and revenue cutters in Bering Sea.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwin F. Uhl</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d195-a1.xml" xpointer="d195-a1"/>
            </div>
